WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.140
Several sites, one job: who does what?

2
00:00:03.883 --> 00:00:08.183
Four sites: cloud, headquarters, workshop, harbour office.

3
00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:14.750
The harbour office fetches the weather, the workshop writes with local AI, headquarters combines both.

4
00:00:15.483 --> 00:00:18.883
All of it runs encrypted, with no entrance from outside.

5
